    {"claim_id":"cockpit_claim_05_driving_compute_domain_control","theme_id":"intelligent_driving_smart_cockpit_value_chain_v1","source_id":"cockpit_002920_ar2025","claim_text":"智驾域控制器的价值来自车规计算、接口、散热、基础软件、传感器接入、平台复用和规模交付；明确分业务收入与量产车型比单纯大算力概念更能验证材料性。","claim_type":"value_capture","confidence":0.98,"evidence_status":"verified","platform_use_status":"reviewed","supporting_source_ids":["cockpit_002906_ar2025","cockpit_002405_ar2025","cockpit_688326_ar2025","cockpit_301488_ar2025"],"affected_theme_nodes":["intelligent_driving_compute_domain_control"]},
    {"claim_id":"cockpit_claim_06_driving_software_l2_boundary","theme_id":"intelligent_driving_smart_cockpit_value_chain_v1","source_id":"cockpit_002920_ar2025","claim_text":"L2/L2+功能量产不等于高阶自动驾驶收入；辅助驾驶、NOA、L3/L4能力和自动驾驶软件必须按功能范围、责任边界、量产车型及独立收入分别验证。","claim_type":"risk","confidence":0.99,"evidence_status":"verified","platform_use_status":"reviewed","supporting_source_ids":["cockpit_002405_ar2025","cockpit_688326_ar2025","cockpit_688088_ar2025","cockpit_002970_ar2025","cockpit_301488_ar2025","cockpit_301221_ar2025"],"affected_theme_nodes":["intelligent_driving_compute_domain_control","planning_decision_middleware_driving_software"]},
    {"claim_id":"cockpit_claim_07_by_wire_cross_chain","theme_id":"intelligent_driving_smart_cockpit_value_chain_v1","source_id":"cockpit_688326_ar2025","claim_text":"智驾决策需要制动、转向、动力和底盘接口执行，但线控硬件本体归electric_drive_chassis_by_wire_thermal_management等链，本主题只保留控制接口、冗余、功能安全和系统集成依赖，不重复所有权。","claim_type":"bottleneck","confidence":0.99,"evidence_status":"verified","platform_use_status":"reviewed","supporting_source_ids":["cockpit_301221_ar2025"],"affected_theme_nodes":["by_wire_execution_vehicle_control_dependency","system_integration_validation_safety_compliance"]},
    {"claim_id":"cockpit_claim_08_cockpit_compute_cross_chain","theme_id":"intelligent_driving_smart_cockpit_value_chain_v1","source_id":"cockpit_300496_ar2025","claim_text":"座舱SoC和车规计算平台是应用底座，但芯片本体归automotive_electronics_chip_applications链；本主题只研究OS、中间件、平台适配和座舱应用对算力的依赖，不重复所有权。","claim_type":"bottleneck","confidence":0.99,"evidence_status":"verified","platform_use_status":"reviewed","supporting_source_ids":["cockpit_002906_ar2025","cockpit_002405_ar2025"],"affected_theme_nodes":["cockpit_soc_compute_platform_dependency"]},
    {"claim_id":"cockpit_claim_09_cockpit_domain_os_middleware","theme_id":"intelligent_driving_smart_cockpit_value_chain_v1","source_id":"cockpit_300496_ar2025","claim_text":"座舱域控、AIOS、虚拟化和中间件通过软硬解耦、跨芯片适配和量产服务承接价值；智能汽车宽口径收入仍不能直接视作单一OS或座舱软件收入。","claim_type":"value_capture","confidence":0.97,"evidence_status":"verified","platform_use_status":"reviewed","supporting_source_ids":["cockpit_002920_ar2025","cockpit_002906_ar2025","cockpit_002405_ar2025","cockpit_688326_ar2025","cockpit_301221_ar2025"],"affected_theme_nodes":["cockpit_domain_control_os_middleware"]},
    {"claim_id":"cockpit_claim_10_display_hud_hmi","theme_id":"intelligent_driving_smart_cockpit_value_chain_v1","source_id":"cockpit_002906_ar2025","claim_text":"显示、HUD/AR-HUD、数字声学和3D HMI的价值来自光学性能、交互软件、量产良率与客户平台复用；汽车电子宽收入不能全部下沉为HUD或HMI收入。","claim_type":"value_capture","confidence":0.97,"evidence_status":"verified","platform_use_status":"reviewed","supporting_source_ids":["cockpit_002920_ar2025","cockpit_300496_ar2025","cockpit_688326_ar2025","cockpit_002456_ar2025","cockpit_301221_ar2025"],"affected_theme_nodes":["display_hud_acoustics_human_machine_interaction"]},
    {"claim_id":"cockpit_claim_11_dms_oms_fusion_validation","theme_id":"intelligent_driving_smart_cockpit_value_chain_v1","source_id":"cockpit_688088_ar2025","claim_text":"DMS/OMS已有法规认证、量产车型和车载AI收入可验证；舱驾融合样品或项目不等于成熟利润，POC、原型、可量产状态、定点和即将量产必须与规模收入分开。","claim_type":"catalyst","confidence":0.99,"evidence_status":"verified","platform_use_status":"reviewed","supporting_source_ids":["cockpit_002920_ar2025","cockpit_002906_ar2025","cockpit_300496_ar2025","cockpit_002405_ar2025","cockpit_688326_ar2025","cockpit_002456_ar2025","cockpit_002970_ar2025","cockpit_301221_ar2025"],"affected_theme_nodes":["dms_oms_cockpit_driving_fusion","cockpit_domain_control_os_middleware"]},
    {"claim_id":"cockpit_claim_12_integration_safety_compliance","theme_id":"intelligent_driving_smart_cockpit_value_chain_v1","source_id":"cockpit_688326_ar2025","claim_text":"从样件到量产必须经过车型适配、ASPICE、ISO 26262/21448、网络安全、数据合规、测试验证、供应链和持续交付，系统集成和验证能力本身构成壁垒。","claim_type":"bottleneck","confidence":0.98,"evidence_status":"verified","platform_use_status":"reviewed","supporting_source_ids":["cockpit_002920_ar2025","cockpit_002405_ar2025","cockpit_688088_ar2025","cockpit_002970_ar2025","cockpit_301488_ar2025","cockpit_301221_ar2025"],"affected_theme_nodes":["system_integration_validation_safety_compliance"]},
    {"claim_id":"cockpit_claim_13_aftermarket_lifecycle_gap","theme_id":"intelligent_driving_smart_cockpit_value_chain_v1","source_id":"cockpit_002970_ar2025","claim_text":"商用车后装、车队运营、SaaS、OTA、远程运维和数据服务可延长单车价值，但后装硬件、AI解决方案和云平台收入未完全拆分，续费率与生命周期服务收入仍是缺口。","claim_type":"risk","confidence":0.96,"evidence_status":"verified","platform_use_status":"reviewed","supporting_source_ids":[],"affected_theme_nodes":["aftermarket_operations_lifecycle_services"]},
    {"claim_id":"cockpit_claim_14_revenue_project_maturity_boundary","theme_id":"intelligent_driving_smart_cockpit_value_chain_v1","source_id":"cockpit_002920_ar2025","claim_text":"定点、合作或开发中不等于量产收入；宽汽车电子、智能汽车、智云、电子产品、AI解决方案和智能汽车产品收入不能自动归入单一节点，必须同时锁定产品关系、量产阶段、收入材料性、客户验证和风险边界。","claim_type":"risk","confidence":0.99,"evidence_status":"verified","platform_use_status":"reviewed","supporting_source_ids":["cockpit_002906_ar2025","cockpit_300496_ar2025","cockpit_002405_ar2025","cockpit_688326_ar2025","cockpit_688088_ar2025","cockpit_002456_ar2025","cockpit_002970_ar2025","cockpit_301488_ar2025","cockpit_301221_ar2025"],"affected_theme_nodes":["vehicle_perception_sensors_dependency","perception_algorithms_data_closed_loop","positioning_mapping_inertial_navigation","intelligent_driving_compute_domain_control","planning_decision_middleware_driving_software","by_wire_execution_vehicle_control_dependency","cockpit_soc_compute_platform_dependency","cockpit_domain_control_os_middleware","display_hud_acoustics_human_machine_interaction","dms_oms_cockpit_driving_fusion","system_integration_validation_safety_compliance","aftermarket_operations_lifecycle_services"]}
